  "Skor Ekosistem: jarak ke <b>tepi</b> poligon terdekat (≤0,5 km = 1, 0,5–1 = 2, 1–2 = 3, 2–5 = 4, &gt;5 km = 5).": "Ecosystem score: distance to the nearest polygon <b>edge</b> (≤0.5 km = 1, 0.5–1 = 2, 1–2 = 3, 2–5 = 4, &gt;5 km = 5).",
