  "Copernicus Marine Service (CMEMS); Te = VTM10 (periode energi). Rata-rata bulanan/musiman/tahunan dipakai grafik; setiap klik peta diinterpolasi IDW dari keempat titik ini. Kode produk/dataset dan tanggal unduh belum tercatat; berkas mentah tidak ada di <code>01_raw</code> (angka tertanam di <code>assets/js/data.js</code>).": "Copernicus Marine Service (CMEMS); Te = VTM10 (energy period). Monthly/seasonal/annual means are used by the charts; every map click is IDW-interpolated from these four points. The product/dataset code and download date have not been recorded; the raw file is not in <code>01_raw</code> (figures are embedded in <code>assets/js/data.js</code>).",
